	measure 'NASA Improvement %' = ```
			
			VAR LrNasa =
			    CALCULATE (
			        AVERAGE ( FactModelMetric[metric_value] ),
			        DimModel[model_name] = "LinearRegression",
			        FactModelMetric[metric_name] = "test_nasa_score"
			    )
			VAR XgbNasa =
			    CALCULATE (
			        AVERAGE ( FactModelMetric[metric_value] ),
			        DimModel[model_name] = "XGBoost",
			        FactModelMetric[metric_name] = "test_nasa_score"
			    )
			RETURN
			DIVIDE ( LrNasa - XgbNasa, LrNasa, 0 )
			
			```
